{"title":"2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Note:\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note:</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, define the operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a737670d481129e2ead6d7223437f3cf70ea53f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/a/25a7644ee3d0b1d85e40b4ffd2e26eff4e2532c1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x \\Delta y = x^3+y^2+x+y.\\]\" width=\"184\" height=\"19\" /> Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/8/7888ec6e1cd3c45c7d43cf6d157a7cb515a06cb1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{\\dfrac{257 \\Delta 256}{258}}.\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"43\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/e/36e85b07553b14840db83702cb8794e836eee86d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$258=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/f/6afa34ebe4f45c857352660ae8c6f3eb23322e0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$257=a-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/c/23c9c138127be7c6723fc42b0e0bbd03d58652dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256=a-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />. We substitute these values into expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa3912cc0091da88524e46150917fb00d3f5f980.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{\\frac{(a-1) \\Delta (a-2)}{a}}.\\]\" width=\"149\" height=\"43\" /> Recall the definition for the operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a737670d481129e2ead6d7223437f3cf70ea53f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />; using this, we simplify our expression to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/7/797617fa8cdf4fa87b2e01967b8362c3aae38a17.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{\\frac{(a-1)^3+(a-2)^2+(a-1)+(a-2)}{a}}.\\]\" width=\"325\" height=\"43\" /> We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/d/8ed125e37a968632940797f42bcabcf6fd96a462.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-1)^3=a^3-3a^2+3a-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"223\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d2b02e7ac4e6d4141695de2d4d013a8303034ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-2)^2=a^2-4a+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"178\" height=\"21\" />, so we can expand the numerator of the fraction within the square root as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f1368081e9ed523f677054d998a00e2cc3de9210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3-3a^2+3a-1+a^2-4a+4+a-1+a-2=a^3-2a^2+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"499\" height=\"18\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/5/0e575ae30085afa9cb4b73c442e8514404c1d35c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{\\frac{a^3-2a^2+a}{a}}=\\sqrt{a^2-2a+1}=\\sqrt{(a-1)^2}=a-1=\\boxed{257}.\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"43\" /> ~samrocksnature\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Basically the same as above, but instead we can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/9/a69c564b5af6c1a1c6abc40986308f6c422fdcd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$257 = 256 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" />. Then we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/4/d44597c9aa14ae918f72a0a776c517e722bf8ce2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{\\frac{(256+1)(256^2 + 256 + 1) + 1(256^2 + 257) + 256}{258}},\\]\" width=\"405\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/0/2906b58eb6443dfe4f89b6f9cbf61c70c1afef06.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{\\frac{258(256^2 + 257) + 256}{258}},\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/e/08e12f3ac0becd0d2ffed1fa9e29f2ba184d3d79.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{256^2 + 256 + 256 + 1} =\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6e21bb98bf0691538af26878400d095c5588521.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{256^2 + 2\\cdot256 + 1} =\\]\" width=\"170\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/3/663ba7c5cd296eb55e4db32b532d26e4b20b4370.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{(256+1)^2} =\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"32\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/b/3ab423f4d6b6ca108349d1135ce1b9bac73bd59b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{(257^2)}\\]\" width=\"65\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>which equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/7/8d77b60d1b8f22d8ec7c13b5a340bd93c485fa62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{257}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~~abhinavg0627\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note:\">Note:</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Note:\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db42e5ed088ca1f04764e8a2a795590bf3d95fc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$257^3 = 16974593$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"134\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/7/9c7e8eda14e7b2c691038536f0c218d1575427ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$256^2 = 65536$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/23465da91c36404ee1d9048335ab1bece5fdc0e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$257^2 = 66049$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa9c5574d0325c0ec291bc925ef57d59bf4262bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />, substituting this in, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c51ddfd6e7d7b1845a107cc457cd157c2fcf96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2(x+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"21\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb83232a405d2729eef89fbe93a8ffabb9ae6257.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\frac{257^2(258)}{258}}=\\boxed{257}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"163\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>- kante314 -\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Problems\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems\">Other 2021 JMPSC Sprint Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Sprint_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Sprint Answer Key\">2021 JMPSC Sprint Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JMPSC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"JMPSC Problems and Solutions\">All JMPSC Problems and Solutions</a></li></ol>\n<p>The problems on this page are copyrighted by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://jmpsc.org\">Junior Mathematicians' Problem Solving Competition</a>. <span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:JMPSC.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/120px-JMPSC.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/180px-JMPSC.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/a/ab/JMPSC.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018020115\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 170/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 183/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5549/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.272      1 Template:JMPSC_Notice\n100.00%    5.272      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21621:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018020115 and revision id 158205. Rendering was triggered because: api-pa